{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>When you go to return to Egypt, etc.</b> Know that on this condition you go — that you be strong in My mission to perform all My signs before Pharaoh, and not fear him." "<b>Which I have placed in your hand.</b> Not the three signs mentioned above, for he was not commanded to perform them before Pharaoh but before Israel, that they would believe him — and we do not find that he performed them before him. Rather, the wonders that I am destined to place in your hand in Egypt, as in ״כִּי יְדַבֵּר אֲלֵיכֶם פַּרְעֹה וְגוֹ״ (Exodus 7). And do not wonder that it is written ״אֲשֶׁר שַׂמְתִּי״, for so does it convey: when you speak with him, I have already placed them in your hand."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:50:34.022463133Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}